  "description": "Beom Tae-Hyeok buys Moon Yi-Soo for 100 million won while she is working as a server at a loan-shark club to pay off her boyfriend's debt. \n\n\"You’ll have to prove you’re worth 100 million won,\" he says. \n\n\"How?\" \n\n\"With your body.\" \n\nWhen Yi-Soo asks if she can just work to pay it back, Tae-Hyeok sneers coldly. \n\n\"I don't need the money. I need a maid to play with.\"\n\nEventually, Yi-Soo signs the maid contract, and from that night on, her body and heart begin to surrender to Tae-Hyeok in their dizzying encounters.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14141610), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498026806), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/tigernight), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/tigernight), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080060)",
